<title>NEW ZEALAND: ANZ NZ nine month net profit rises to NZ$118.4 mln.</title>
<headline>ANZ NZ nine month net profit rises to NZ$118.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ANZ Bank (New Zealand), a unit of the Australia and New Zealand Banking Group, on Friday reported a net profit of NZ$118.4 million for the nine months to June 30 against $114.3 million a year earlier.  </p>
<p>The company reported a third quarter $41 million profit, up 10.5 percent.</p>
<p>Total assets increased $2.2 billion to $19.8 billion from June 30, 1995.</p>
<p>Total lending assets were $14.8 billion against $13.1 billion.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
